 "statement": "For the proper piece $p$ and every strict-perfect $F^\\bullet$ on $Y$,\n\n$$\n(Rp_*j_!E)\\otimes^LF^\\bullet\n\\xrightarrow[\\pi_{p,j_!E,F}]{\\sim}\nRp_*(j_!E\\otimes^LLp^*F^\\bullet),\n$$\n\nwith inverse $\\rho_{p,j_!E,F}$.",
